  {
    "index": 3,
    "hash": "aVtyTIaQJANfD9PgvLaJuydbdCI=",
    "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-20T10:34:34.670Z",
    "action": {
      "type": "SET_CONTENT",
      "input": {
        "content": "Step three of the scenario is stated in two lines: set endpoint, configure webhook.\n\nA configuration-only seam is what makes the channel strategy viable. If integrating required patching or forking the companion product, every consultancy deployment would carry a maintenance burden that the consultancy \u2014 not Powerhouse \u2014 would have to own, and the offer would stop being an easy addition to an existing proposition.\n\nIt also matches what the tool screen found elsewhere: the tools worth integrating with expose webhooks, hooks or event listeners as first-class configuration, and that seam is usually available in the freely-licensed edition.",
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-20T10:34:34.670530Z"
      },
      "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-20T10:34:34.670535Z"
    }
  },
